Design note (why the echo carries the chip's line box): the first attempt
used a fixed 17 pt min-height frame, but the rendered repo capsule is
~20.7 pt (SF caption2 line box + 2 pt vertical padding); measuring the
captures showed a ~4 pt row shrink under the filter. The final echo
repeats the chip's own caption2 font in a transparent spacer (opacity(0),
deterministic layout) + the chip's vertical padding, so the row keeps the
chip's exact height; pixel measurement confirms 0 px delta.

